'''Raw pysk fish (0)''' is a type of fish obtained by from fishing spots within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Raw pysk fish require level 1 in Fishing to catch and grants the player 20 [[experience]] when caught.

They are cooked with a [[Cooking]] level of 1 to produce [[pysk fish (0)]], granting 10 experience in Cooking.

